  "extraction_notes": [
    "The supplied five-page datasheet is titled HL3400A N-CHANNEL MOSFET and is marked Rev:1.1.",
    "Output, transfer, and capacitance traces were digitized directly from the vector plots on p. 3 Figs. 1, 2, and 5 at selected axis positions; no unsupported curve family or interpolated datasheet claim was added.",
