    "Ciss is published as a MAX value of 1050 pF; Coss is published as a TYP value of 99 pF; Crss is published as a TYP value of 77 pF. The shared table condition is VDS = 15 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz, Ta = 25 degC.",
    "No typical VGS(th) value is published. The guaranteed threshold range is 0.7 V minimum to 1.4 V maximum at VDS = VGS and ID = 250 uA.",
    "The three published RDS(ON) rows are maximum values: 35 mOhm at VGS = 10 V and ID = 5.8 A; 40 mOhm at VGS = 4.5 V and ID = 5.0 A; 52 mOhm at VGS = 2.5 V and ID = 4.0 A.",
